// The actual GL calls for one frame: load the projection, clear + place the
// modelview, then submit the whole particle cloud as one gl_draw_points
// call and present. Split into 3 small functions to keep each block at or
// under the 3-action limit, the same decomposition demos/gl3d/scene/
// render/draw.id uses for gl_draw_tris.

draw_scene(int combined_matrix, int projection_matrix) {
  gl_set_projection(projection_matrix);
  clear_and_place(combined_matrix);
  submit_points();
} return void;
